WEBVTT

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:26.750
<i>New days, it's the morning we begin. 
Let's give the world a kiss.</i>

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:35.240
<i>Blowing in the wind, with a little 
courage and love in our pockets.</i>

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:44.090
<i>I wish: If only I had wings,</i>

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:53.690
<i>I could fly over the sadness, 
the past, and my doubts.</i>

00:00:53.690 --> 00:01:02.450
<i>Oh, yeah! There's nothing to lose. 
(Take whatever the brand new day brings.)</i>

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:07.290
<i>Take my way! I wanna catch a miracle...</i>

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:11.030
<i>in the palm of my hand!</i>

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:19.720
<i>We're off on a journey through the endless 
earth, the skies, and the future.</i>

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:32.140
<i>I know these newborn wings, oh! 
Are gonna gonna gonna shine someday!</i>

00:01:34.990 --> 00:01:38.280
I... What should I do?

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:40.990
Is something bothering you?

00:01:43.790 --> 00:01:45.120
That's kinda surprising.

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:47.130
From our point of view,

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:49.250
we've always thought of 
you as a god or something.

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:53.710
I want to hear your opinion.

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:57.880
There is something that I wish 
you to see. The truth behind us.

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:07.850
"Lost Quintet"

00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:11.670
Where are you going, Guardian?

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:15.360
I have to do something to help 
Senes get this ship moving again.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:18.240
So, they'll kill 1,000 per day?

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:20.870
I find it troubling that you're 
so unsettled over such a matter.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:22.780
Do you understand?

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:27.080
She could never live with herself if 
a lot of people died because of her.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.880
You'll die, too.

00:02:29.580 --> 00:02:32.040
Emotions are a nuisance, aren't they?

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:35.000
But you don't need to worry 
about that any longer.

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:42.390
M-Mother!

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:45.850
Who are you?!

00:02:46.310 --> 00:02:47.210
It's my father.

00:02:47.210 --> 00:02:47.850
What?

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:49.490
Mjollnir, strike!

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.510
Pretty decisive, aren't you?

00:02:55.510 --> 00:02:57.530
That was your father just 
now, but you still...

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:00.320
My father is no longer among the living.

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.100
I was the one who washed his cold corpse,

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:05.280
and I was the one who lit his funeral pyre.

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:08.290
Those memories aren't vague enough to let me

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.250
be easily taken in by a phony like that.

00:03:11.290 --> 00:03:12.390
Let's hurry.

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:14.790
If they've left the two of 
us behind, that means that

00:03:14.790 --> 00:03:18.460
Natalie and Zefiris might be planning 
to do something to Shannon and Pacifica.

00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.710
And they saved us ordinary 
folks for later, huh?

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:22.610
Anyway, let's get to the core area.

00:03:22.610 --> 00:03:24.760
Getting the Skid moving again comes first.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:25.680
Right.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:28.890
We ordinary types should go assert 
ourselves in the only way we can.

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:31.600
Yeah. Let's get to the 
capital, no matter what.

00:03:36.610 --> 00:03:39.530
Whew! Here we are, safe and sound!

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:41.510
We're here...

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:43.010
It's the capital.

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:44.200
Hey! You there!

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:46.490
What's this thing?

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:47.950
It's Mr. Soopie.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.710
I can't believe that the Scrapped Princess 
managed to escape into the Giat Empire...

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:52.750
Neither can I, sire.

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:56.920
Cardinal Hogue, I obeyed the revelation.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:59.510
I ordered that the newborn 
princess be killed!

00:03:59.510 --> 00:04:03.520
Mauser knows all you have done, my king.

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:07.260
However, the day of destiny 
draws nearer moment by moment.

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:11.310
The day in which the world will be 
destroyed by the Scrapped Princess.

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:12.480
I know that!

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:16.730
We must hurry, then... We must 
find the Scrapped Princess and...

00:04:17.330 --> 00:04:19.440
Yes, sire. At all costs.

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:25.410
You're aware that a Giat ship has violated 
our territorial waters, I take it?

00:04:25.410 --> 00:04:26.710
Of course.

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:28.700
And we've heard something 
about the Scrapped Princess

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:30.180
making contact with Scarlet.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:32.540
There are persistent rumors going around

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:36.170
that she might be conspiring 
with Scarlet to attack us.

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:38.460
Oh, brother... Something's 
definitely about to happen.

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:43.670
And the King's apparently issued an 
order directly to the Royal Forces, too.

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:46.340
To muster all our forces and 
kill the Scrapped Princess.

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:49.280
If she's killed by our forces 
while under Giat's protection,

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:50.850
it'll cause a war.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:51.880
Right.

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:55.940
And Jill has seen some disturbing 
things in her visions. Jill?

00:04:55.940 --> 00:05:00.070
If it comes down to it, the military 
might even use that spell.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:01.530
What spell?

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:06.820
The long-range, tactical grade offensive 
spell that was banned by treaty.

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.200
The Giat Empire...

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:13.500
If I could only get my hands on their 
technology and military power, I could...

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.620
It's tantalizing, isn't it?

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:17.570
Their territories, too.

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:18.680
That's certainly true.

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:21.340
You have to take what you 
want when it's within reach.

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:25.010
That's true... This is 
the perfect opportunity.

00:05:25.010 --> 00:05:27.300
Besides, you also have that, don't you?

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:31.100
The long-range tactical 
grade offensive spell.

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:32.240
Ginnungagap...

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:36.730
Pardon me, sir.

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:39.730
Is something the matter, General?

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:41.690
It's nothing.

00:05:42.610 --> 00:05:44.190
What's...

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:48.320
This is an illusion I have recreated 
in order to explain matters to you.

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:52.200
This realm is what you 
humans call "outer space."

00:05:53.450 --> 00:05:58.000
At one time, humanity possessed 
power enough to reach this realm.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.040
Oh...

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:02.670
But one day, an enemy 
appeared before humanity.

00:06:02.670 --> 00:06:06.010
They suddenly appeared out 
of the depths of space

00:06:06.010 --> 00:06:09.300
and began to attack humanity 
for reasons unknown.

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:11.980
Oh, Miss Eirote said something about this.

00:06:11.980 --> 00:06:14.940
I always thought it was a myth, though.

00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:19.350
This enemy was an intelligent 
lifeform other than humanity.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:22.690
In our language, they are called the H.I.

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:26.030
The battle between humanity 
and the H.I. dragged on.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:32.530
And so, we Dragoons were created by humanity.

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:37.120
Ultimate weapons with unimaginable 
power that rivaled that of the gods.

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:40.860
For that reason, we were called the 
Beasts of the End of the World.

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:49.340
But there was a design flaw in the 
Dragoon control artificial intelligence.

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:52.720
It was unable to withstand 
complex, advanced programs,

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:55.930
which led to a series 
of mishaps in the field.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:07:01.900
Out of 200 mass-production 
models, 174 became inoperative,

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:05.440
and even in the 26 units that 
somehow avoided an A.I. breakdown,

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:09.360
heavy protection protocols were put in 
place to guard against further incidents.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:12.110
Except in cases of self-defense,

00:07:12.740 --> 00:07:15.450
we were made unable to use 
90% of our combat programs

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:18.430
without the authorization 
of our pilot, the D-Knight.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:27.710
Stay awake!

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:28.760
I'm listening, I'm listening...

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:33.550
In short, we were no longer 
able to operate properly,

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.930
and so were assigned to local battles.

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:40.980
This is when the fully autonomous 
Valkyrie-types, our upgraded versions,

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:43.400
were sent into battle.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:46.900
But the Valkyrie-types were brainwashed 
by the enemy and turned against us.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.900
These are the Peacemakers.

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:50.620
Um...

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:53.740
They were once on our side.

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:59.160
Our defeat was a direct 
result of their betrayal.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:04.370
Afterwards, the Peacemakers took on 
the role of humanity's administrators.

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:06.100
And as for me...

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:10.340
B-Big brother?

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.010
No, that's not him.

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.840
That is Lord Becknam, my former master.

00:08:14.840 --> 00:08:18.640
Zefy, I'm sorry, but I 
can't go on any longer.

00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.850
Thank you for fighting 
by my side all this time.

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:23.190
And I'm sorry.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:24.060
You can't!

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:27.770
I was able to go on existing 
because you accepted me!

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:30.300
It's because you weren't afraid of me

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:32.570
that I didn't break down like my sisters!

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:35.200
If I lost you, I'd...

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:37.380
Zefy, please.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:39.540
I want you to survive.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.620
I know this will be hard for you,

00:08:44.190 --> 00:08:45.440
but I want you to survive

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:49.500
and give your assistance to our 
children in the distant future.

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:50.960
Lord Becknam!

00:08:51.780 --> 00:08:52.920
No!!

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:56.680
Don't die! Don't die! Don't die!

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:58.890
No!

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:07.850
And so I waited.

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:10.230
Obeying the orders of my late master,

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:13.940
I awaited the coming of the 
ones I was meant to help.

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:16.540
But only because my master wished it.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:20.950
What you encountered at the lake that day

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:23.700
was the pale shadow of a Dragoon 
who had lost her master.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:29.670
I am no longer certain.

00:09:29.990 --> 00:09:33.810
I had thought of you people as pawns.

00:09:33.810 --> 00:09:35.970
As tools to help me carry out my mission.

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:37.630
Even my brother Shannon?

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:44.390
But for some reason, I am 
unable to ignore your wishes.

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:46.450
There is no reason for it,

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:50.120
but it feels as if that would 
mean betraying my master.

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:52.610
I am a weapon.

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:57.990
My power is capable of snuffing 
out many lives in an instant.

00:09:57.990 --> 00:10:00.910
I cannot act solely on my own initiative.

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:05.080
That is why I have never made 
a single decision for myself.

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:07.210
I had no authority to make that decision.

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:10.630
I always had my master decide for me.

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:13.460
But that person no longer exists.

00:10:14.130 --> 00:10:17.590
But Shannon's your master 
now, isn't he, Zefiris?

00:10:18.550 --> 00:10:22.010
I do not believe that Shannon 
will trust me any longer.

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.990
Pacifica Cassul.

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:27.890
Even when you learned what 
I was, you did not fear me.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:31.520
You treated me the same way my master did.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:34.550
That is why I wish to ask <i>you</i>.

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:37.490
What should I do?

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:44.530
What is it? What's wrong?

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:47.000
Natalie has begun to brainwash Shannon.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.120
Brainwash him?! What for?

00:10:49.520 --> 00:10:53.540
To turn him into someone who would feel 
no remorse if it meant protecting you,

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:59.010
even if that meant sacrificing the lives 
of millions of people in the capital.

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:15.110
She's adorable!

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:20.070
I managed to save her using my magic 
just before she hit the valley floor.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:21.660
Well done.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:24.620
I see that you're a full-fledged 
Court Wizard now.

00:11:24.620 --> 00:11:27.390
I'm nothing compared to you, Lady Carol.

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:28.580
What's her name?

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:30.540
She has none.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:33.490
Leave everything to us.

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:35.500
You should hurry back.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:36.680
I'll be going, then.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:39.840
Carol?

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:41.720
How could they not give her a name?

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:42.610
If it were me,

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:45.100
and I found out that Shannon or 
Raquel were about to be killed,

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:47.010
I'd throw away all I had to protect them.

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:49.980
You have the power to do that.

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:53.520
All the queen has is a position 
of grave responsibility.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:56.270
If they ever find out 
that this baby escaped...

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:58.480
We'll have to give her a name.

00:11:58.480 --> 00:12:00.990
A name that'll make everyone 
around her love her.

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:02.950
You're right...

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:09.410
So tell me, what's your name?

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.370
Pacifica...

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:24.390
Know what this is?

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:25.680
The Ancients' language?

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:28.490
Yeah, except they called it 
"English" or something like that.

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:32.730
"Use emergency circuits. Connect 
power to central mechanisms.

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:35.190
Yes or no?"

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:37.240
Yes...

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:42.610
Power's online!

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:45.070
Princess Senes...

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:53.860
I can't believe that you are 
really going through with it.

00:12:54.770 --> 00:12:56.750
It's taking effect.

00:12:56.750 --> 00:13:00.960
We have to make the Guardian fully aware 
of who it is that he should protect.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.010
We are weapons, and we are servants.

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:06.430
These methods go against 
our very reason for being.

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:09.680
I thought this person was 
nothing more than a substitute.

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:12.680
Big brother!

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:19.060
Big brother?

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:23.030
It's all right, Pacifica.

00:13:23.880 --> 00:13:25.990
I'll keep you safe.

00:13:26.610 --> 00:13:29.490
Father and Mother want that, too.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.790
Natalie, what have you done to him?!

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.870
I showed him data from the past, that's all.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:38.080
To have him recognize you again 
as something irreplaceable.

00:13:40.260 --> 00:13:42.840
They must've connected 
the emergency circuits.

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:44.300
Pacifica! Shannon!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:45.570
Sis!

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:46.680
Are you all right?!

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:47.550
Something's wrong with Shannon!

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:50.010
What's the matter? Shannon?

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:54.890
I'm going to make this mobile 
fortress self-destruct.

00:13:54.890 --> 00:13:55.430
What?

00:13:56.020 --> 00:13:58.360
This fortress is your vessel.

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:00.150
If it self-destructs, you'll...

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:01.650
This is the best way.

00:14:02.050 --> 00:14:04.110
You people need to escape.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.610
Going to the capital in this 
Vanguard for the sole purpose

00:14:06.610 --> 00:14:09.610
of being killed by the 
Peacemakers is foolish.

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.200
Natalie...

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:14.390
You're beginning to recover 
your original strength, too.

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:15.330
You should get clear.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:19.960
The Providence Breaker's abilities 
will manifest in 1,000 hours.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:20.790
Is that clear?

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:24.390
Pacifica...

00:14:25.140 --> 00:14:26.530
Run away with me.

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:28.470
No!

00:14:28.470 --> 00:14:31.530
Lots of people in the 
capital might be killed!

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:33.430
We can't run away!

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:35.390
Why'd you mess with Shannon's head?!

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:40.220
Pacifica, assist me.

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:43.320
We will return Shannon to his old self.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.190
We need to get out of here first!

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:49.110
It would be too late then.

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:51.130
Once he leaves this tampering field,

00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:52.910
the brainwashing can never be broken.

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:54.420
Give up on him.

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:57.120
He's no use to us now.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:14:59.080
You shut your mouth.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:03.790
Zefiris, what do I need to do?

00:15:03.790 --> 00:15:05.940
All you can do is dive into his mind

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:07.760
and persuade him to come back.

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:09.340
But if you slip up,

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:11.620
your consciousness will be unable to return.

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:13.470
I'll do it.

00:15:13.470 --> 00:15:16.100
The brainwashing centers 
around Pacifica Cassul.

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.720
Only she can do this.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:19.390
What about you?

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:22.400
Even though we can dive into 
the consciousness of a human,

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:23.940
we cannot tamper with it.

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:25.320
Don't do this, Zefiris.

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.820
Make one mistake, and we'll 
lose not only the Guardian,

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:30.280
but the Providence Breaker as well.

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:33.490
I'll... I'll do it.

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:34.370
Pacifica?

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:38.450
I want Shannon to stay who he is.

00:15:38.450 --> 00:15:42.580
We may be the Providence 
Breaker and Dragon Knight

00:15:42.580 --> 00:15:45.030
or all this other stuff I don't understand,

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:48.340
but I didn't want to be born 
as the Scrapped Princess.

00:15:49.340 --> 00:15:51.720
Helping out around the house each day,

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:55.350
marrying someone, having children,

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:58.720
growing old, and being surrounded 
by my grandchildren...

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:00.310
I wish it could've been like that.

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:04.940
I wish I'd never learned 
this world's secrets.

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:08.230
That way, nobody would have had to suffer.

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:11.820
You say this world is sealed off, but 
I can't wrap my head around that.

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.280
And even if you bring up all that 
stuff that happened 5,000 years ago,

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.830
it doesn't make any sense to me.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:19.740
But you and the others wanting to carry 
out your old masters' wishes, Zefiris,

00:16:19.740 --> 00:16:21.410
<i>that </i>I can understand.

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.790
I understand that just fine.

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:26.750
But what does that mean for us?

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:35.640
I'm going.

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:53.070
I swear, only you could 
pull a stunt like this.

00:16:53.530 --> 00:16:56.570
Getting into a fight to the death 
with the chickens over an omelet.

00:16:56.570 --> 00:16:59.030
You've been losing a lot lately.

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:04.200
Aw, am I gonna go without 
an omelet again today?

00:17:07.200 --> 00:17:09.380
Thanks, Dad!

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.380
Thanks for waiting!

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:21.010
Yummy!

00:17:32.480 --> 00:17:33.650
What's the matter?

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:39.780
I'm not really your and 
Raquel's little sister, am I?

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:43.240
I mean, I'm the only blonde one,

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:46.160
and I heard the people in 
the village talking, too.

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:48.440
What difference does that make?

00:17:48.440 --> 00:17:50.680
You're my little sister.

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:54.340
If they want to talk, let 'em.

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:56.340
You're my little sister, Pacifica.

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:01.810
I wish I could stay like this forever...

00:18:02.840 --> 00:18:04.690
Staying here with you.

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:06.770
Together forever.

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:09.940
I'll keep them safe.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:13.090
I'll protect our way of life 
here, and I'll protect you.

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:16.440
Pacifica, it's about time 
for us to head home, okay?

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:20.410
I don't wanna! I still wanna 
stay here with my big brother!

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:27.830
That's okay. Stay here a 
while longer with Shannon.

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:31.290
I'll keep you safe.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:34.250
Pacifica! Time to go home!

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:37.220
I don't wanna! I wanna stay 
here with my big brother!

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:41.480
That's okay.

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:43.890
Stay here a while longer with Shannon.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.890
I'll keep my little sister safe.

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:49.850
Oh, wow! You're so amazing, big brother!

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:52.150
Hey! What's going on here?!

00:18:52.150 --> 00:18:52.560
Don't!

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:55.940
This is just plain sickening!

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:58.860
I'm scared, big brother!

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:58.860
Who's this weird kid supposed to be?!

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:05.080
Oh, no!

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:09.360
You're so amazing, big brother! I love you!

00:19:20.550 --> 00:19:23.430
Didn't I just tell you 
that that creeps me out?!

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:25.930
Stop letting 'em brainwash you so easily.

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:30.130
C'mon, we're going back!

00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:31.390
We're going back to the real world!

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:34.080
Huh?

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:35.880
Don't give me that crap!

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:37.650
Pacifica?

00:19:37.650 --> 00:19:41.030
I swear, you are <i>so </i>pathetic!

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:44.240
Is <i>that </i>how you've been 
seeing me all these years?!

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:46.850
I don't understand.

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:49.250
How could she break through 
the brainwashing so easily?

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.210
What in the world <i>is </i>this girl?

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:53.460
Come on, get up!

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:54.670
She's our little sister.

00:19:55.590 --> 00:20:00.530
Now we're left with no other option 
than fighting the Peacemakers.

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:05.140
Stand up straight, damn it! Stand up!

00:20:05.140 --> 00:20:05.600
Ow!

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:07.890
Full speed ahead!

00:20:08.210 --> 00:20:10.890
Set course for the Kingdom of Leinwan.

00:20:20.220 --> 00:20:21.320
Thanks.

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:26.070
We never would've gotten our old 
Shannon back if it weren't for you.

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:28.200
It was you who saved him.

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:29.580
It was not I.

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:31.550
Maybe so, but still...

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:34.060
I am sorry.

00:20:35.410 --> 00:20:38.170
It is just as you said.

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:42.380
We have dragged you people into our fight.

00:20:43.230 --> 00:20:44.430
Don't apologize to me.

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.640
That only makes it worse.

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:48.640
I suppose you are right.

00:20:55.520 --> 00:20:57.060
Here they come.

00:20:57.060 --> 00:20:59.150
I've already made arrangements.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:21.730
<i>A blessing of rain falls quietly. (Falls.)</i>

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:27.050
<i>Droplets of my love, 
which fall for someone...</i>

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:34.230
<i>who is still waiting in a land far away.</i>

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:40.020
<i>The morning wind blows, caressing 
my cheek. (What was that...)</i>

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:45.150
<i>Did you feel something, feel something 
just now? (...on my cheek?)</i>

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:48.320
<i>It goes up to the one and only sky... 
(More certain than anything.)</i>

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:53.370
<i>a sky which has a fixed, certain meaning.</i>

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:59.920
<i>I come to a stop in the shadow 
of clouds that chase after me.</i>

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:03.380
<i>This journey of the heart 
that I wish to gaze upon...</i>

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:06.590
<i>goes on forever and goes on forever.</i>

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:13.220
<i>One day I will chance upon the 
voice I've not heard in so long.</i>

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:15.180
<i>Alainn la-li-la.</i>

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>At last the ship sets sail, sets sail. 
(The ship glides on forever...)</i>

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:25.190
<i>Yes, believe in this wide world... 
(...to the edge of seas unknown.)</i>

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:28.530
<i>and go off into the distance.</i>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:32.630
<i>And onwards into the future.</i>

00:22:33.450 --> 00:22:46.460
"Next Time"

00:22:33.920 --> 00:22:36.660
The three Cassul siblings have returned 
to Sauer, ready to die if necessary.

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:38.710
But the harbor is strangely quiet.

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:42.340
Convinced that the fortress that Pacifica 
and the others are aboard is an invader,

00:22:42.340 --> 00:22:44.250
the country's generals seem to have 
a nasty surprise in store for them.

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:47.010
I wish they would cool their heads 
before something terrible happens.

00:22:47.010 --> 00:22:48.410
Next time on <i>Scrapped Princess</i>,

00:22:48.410 --> 00:22:49.680
"Opera of Powers and Plots."

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:50.470
Please tune in!
